#. module: ol_templates
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ol_templates.quote_closing_text
msgid ""
"<strong>Validity</strong>: Processors, RAM, storage devices, and other commodity components, as well as End of Life product prices are valid for 24 hours. All\n"
"                  other pricing is valid for 14 days unless otherwise noted. Prices are for MOQ as stated.<br/>\n"
"                  <strong>Payment</strong>: Prepayment by Credit Card, Bank or Wire transfer required on all orders, unless credit terms are approved.<br/>\n"
"                  <strong>Lead Time</strong>: Lead times depend on order quantity and product availability.<br/>\n"
"                  <strong>Returns &amp; Cancellations</strong>: Special Order items and items ordered in 5+ system quantities or 10+ component quantities are non-returnable and\n"
"                  non-cancelable. Please see our complete Terms and Conditions at www.onlogic.com/terms<br/>\n"
"                  <strong>Warranty</strong>: Systems built and tested by OnLogic are covered under a two year warranty. Additional warranty plans are available."
msgstr ""

